[I] A tool designed for parsing and converting SPIR-V to other shader languages

[T] SPIRV-Cross is a practical tool and library for performing reflection on
[T] SPIR-V and disassembling SPIR-V back to high level languages. 

[U] https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Cross

[A] Spirv-Cross Authors
[M] Jack Jamison <jackqjamison@gmail.com>

